---
// App Store／Google Play 下載鈕（連結來自後台「全站設定」，沒填的就不顯示）
import type { Locale } from '../../lib/i18n';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
  appStoreUrl?: string | null;
  googlePlayUrl?: string | null;
  class?: string;
}

const LABEL: Record<Locale, { appStore: string; googlePlay: string; group: string }> = {
  'zh-Hant': { appStore: '下載', googlePlay: '下載', group: '下載 Aiii VBIM App' },
  en: { appStore: 'Download on the', googlePlay: 'Get it on', group: 'Download the Aiii VBIM app' },
};

const { locale, appStoreUrl, googlePlayUrl, class: className } = Astro.props;
const t = LABEL[locale];
const stores = [
  { label: t.appStore, name: 'App Store', href: appStoreUrl },
  { label: t.googlePlay, name: 'Google Play', href: googlePlayUrl },
].filter((s): s is { label: string; name: string; href: string } => Boolean(s.href));
---

{stores.length > 0 && (
  <div
    class:list={['flex flex-wrap gap-2.5', className]}
    role="group"
    aria-label={t.group}
    data-store-buttons
  >
    {stores.map((s) => (
      <a
        href={s.href}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex min-h-12 flex-col justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-navy px-[22px] py-3 leading-tight font-bold text-white no-underline hover:text-white"
      >
        <span class="text-[11px] text-[#aebdd6]">{s.label}</span>
        <span>{s.name}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
)}
